{"id":"478c99d853e13c93","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-eq-fibration.md","title":"Eq 纤维化","display":"df-equality-fibration — Eq 纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-eq-fibration","aliases":["16-df-eq-fibration","Equality fibration"],"display":"df-equality-fibration — Eq 纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","[[16-df-eq-functor]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]"],"source":"Definition 3.5.1, p. 201 (PDF 221)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-eq-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-eq-fibration</span><span>Equality fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equality-fibration — Eq 纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 3.5.1, p. 201 (PDF 221)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化；预序、纤维有限积、简单等式分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFib}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFrob}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFrob}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d70ce677a3070a45\" href=\"?note=d70ce677a3070a45\" title=\"16-df-eq-functor\">16-df-eq-functor</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibFinProd}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ee7c0663947fd7d2\" href=\"?note=ee7c0663947fd7d2\" title=\"16-df-fibred-finite-products\">16-df-fibred-finite-products</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibPre}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibPre}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equality\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\land\\mathrm{EqFrob}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equality\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\land\\mathrm{EqFrob}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 Jacobs 的 Eq-fibration。后面的正则、coherent、一阶纤维化都继承预序条件。</li>\n<li>非预序纤维化也可有等式伴随，但不直接叫作本章的 Eq-fibration。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 3.5.1, p. 201 (PDF 221)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；预序、纤维有限积、简单等式分别见 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-eq-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；预序、纤维有限积、简单等式分别见 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-eq-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；预序、纤维有限积、简单等式分别见 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-eq-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-functor","status":"resolved","id":"d70ce677a3070a45","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EqFrob}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-eq-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-finite-products","status":"resolved","id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibPre}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinProd}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-finite-limits]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFrob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibFinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibPre}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equality\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{FibFinProd}(p)\\land\\mathrm{EqFrob}(p).","display":true}],"bytes":1593,"backlinks":[{"id":"76ca44cbe35b31cc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为候选纤维化；$\\mathrm{EqFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的规范谓词，$\\mathrm{EqFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本页待定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"fcddcc8eb9f89d5d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal A$ 满足 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]；$K:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal A$、$H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D$ 为函子。$H_I$ 为纤维限制，只在 $qH=Kp$ 时使用。"},{"id":"5b7d7fba37c620c4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a=(\\Gamma,\\Theta)$、$b=(\\Delta,\\Lambda)$ 为下文对象；$\\Theta\\le^H_\\Gamma\\Lambda$、$O_H,M_H,s_H,t_H,e_H,c_H,\\mathcal E_H,p_H$ 在下文构造。$\\mathrm{EqFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]。所有量词限于所列集合编码。"},{"id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e29c92ba515d8b86","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 Eq-fibration，$e_I=\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2)\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$ 是任意二元谓词，未预设为等价关系。"},{"id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；等式、简单余积和 Frobenius 分别见 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]。"},{"id":"92bb081cf777d22b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 满足 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 $\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)$，选定重索引、纤维终对象 $\\top_I$ 及纤维序 $\\le_I$。$\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^\\to$ 为候选理解函子，$\\chi X=(\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX)$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration|df-equality-fibration — Eq 纤维化]]"},{"id":"da549ca22fc9a7df","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 满足 [[16-df-eq-fibration]] 的 $\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)$；$\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]，固定其终对象函子 $T$、理解函子 $C=\\operatorname{dom}\\chi$ 与相应伴随数据。$\\pi_X:CX\\to pX$ 是同一理解结构的投影。"}],"outgoing":["ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","ee7c0663947fd7d2","d70ce677a3070a45","b75e7c168ac56b22"]}